    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91219" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πτολεμ-ᾱϊκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of Ptolemy</i> or <i>the Ptolemies</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ma.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					713.23
				</span></i>
			
